WEBVTT

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:08.400
As we cast our eyes above to the boundless sky, we know

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:16.450
Whatever tomorrow brings, the sun will always shine

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.540
So won't you come with me?

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:37.600
It's almost time for the school bell to ring

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:39.810
And every moment by moment

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:42.230
I feel more and more like I could fly

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:45.690
This feeling fills my thoughts and sets my heart alight

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:49.150
It's this moment I love most of all

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:53.820
In my bag I hold all the things I've overcome

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:57.580
And on their wings, I'll fly into the future

00:00:57.580 --> 00:01:02.080
We can do anything, at any time and any place

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:05.590
And no one can stop us even if they try

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:10.220
From ING and that alone can we proceed

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:14.140
Carrying all our feelings as we go

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:18.140
Flying with our dreams for all to see

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:24.600
Let's close today's chapter, and start a new page!

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:40.510
We travel over hills and whistle as we go

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:44.260
The sky is clear and blue

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:47.770
The rolling fields are all in view

00:01:47.770 --> 00:01:51.210
Let's all sing together

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:53.880
We all hold hands

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.590
La la la la la la la la la

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:59.300
La la la la, Mr. Duck. Quack! Quack!

00:01:59.300 --> 00:01:59.430
La la la la, Mr. Goat, too. Baa! Baa!

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:00.560
It's the shimmering ocean!
La la la la, Mr. Goat, too. Baa! Baa!

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:02.520
La la la la, Mr. Goat, too. Baa! Baa!

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:02.800
The ocean!
La la la la, Mr. Goat, too. Baa! Baa!

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:04.390
La la, let's sing together and all line up
The ocean!

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.860
La la, let's sing together and all line up

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:10.080
Today is a happy day

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:26.880
Okay, students! Listen up!

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:29.840
Everyone has free time until four.

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:32.130
Make sure you're not late for dinner.

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:36.590
Normal civilians aren't allowed to use the hotel's private beach,

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:39.050
but please try not to go overboard,

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:42.430
and no shooting outside the designated times.

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:43.430
Now—

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:47.020
It's free time, kids!

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:52.440
Fujiko-sensei.

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:54.690
The high schoolers are out on their own.
What are you doing here?

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:57.490
Because this is going to be fun, of course.

00:02:57.490 --> 00:02:59.660
Seishou Academy's longest day!

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:00.830
Have fun, you guys!

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:04.660
What are you doing?!

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:06.540
We're going to leave you behind, Japanese Teacher.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:08.290
Um...

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:12.300
Let's go, Sensei!

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:13.710
R-Right.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:19.640
The crashing waves...

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:24.600
The white sands...

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:29.560
The midsummer sun...

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:37.900
More potent than I imagined.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.070
I didn't expect that.

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:42.530
You guys managed to cover yourselves up pretty well.

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:47.000
We're not brave enough to go out wearing thong bikinis.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.540
I don't intend to swim, anyway.

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:53.590
I mean, Galil-chan's got a skeleton stock too,

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:55.010
so she's covering—

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:55.590
She's not!

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:59.760
Wait, Galil-chan!

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:02.180
All right! Let's go for a swim!

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:18.030
FNC?!

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:20.860
Want to have a drink together, Sensei?

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:26.750
It's yummy.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.160
Yeah.

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:35.090
This feels normal, somehow.

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:36.710
Unlike the usual?

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.300
Yeah.

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:40.130
Is normal better?

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.890
Yeah, I guess this isn't bad.

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.360
You're not going to swim? Truly?

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:02.860
"Truly"?

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:08.160
Or are you scared you'll rust?

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:09.410
Unlikely, is it not?

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:11.120
You <i>are</i> a military rifle, aren't you?

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:13.120
And as for you...

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:16.170
You're just a G3-senpai knock-off, right?

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:17.630
I'm the HK33E!

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:19.800
I'm the real younger sister of G3!

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:24.220
G3-senpai's younger sister...

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:25.260
A middle schooler...

00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:29.390
You shouldn't be so big-headed

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:31.310
just because my sister likes you.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:33.310
So, your name's Middle-3, right?

00:05:34.650 --> 00:05:38.480
If you call me by that name again, you will regret it.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:39.780
Sig-chan!

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:42.240
I bought you something to drink!

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:43.360
Ugh.

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:44.320
Who's that?

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:46.320
That was G3-senpai's younger sister,

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:47.410
Middle-3—

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:57.250
I told you that you'd regret it.

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:03.340
What do you think you're doing to library property?

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:04.880
S-Sorry!

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:07.100
You get upset far too quickly!

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:09.140
Your sister's been worried about you!

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:09.760
S-Sorry!

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.390
She keeps bowing her head lower and lower.

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:14.640
She's touching her toes now.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:19.360
Fukko!

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:21.320
Hey, let's go over there!

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:22.860
The castle?

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:25.990
I was just about to suggest that!

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:27.950
Eighteen-chan, what about you and Elle?

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:28.830
What do you think?

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:31.330
I'm good.

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.790
I don't want to go if she's there.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.330
<i>At that time,</i>

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:42.260
<i>we never would have dreamed that this would be the last time we saw her...</i>

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:44.840
Huh? Where did that voice come from?

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:45.680
What <i>was</i> that?

00:06:46.470 --> 00:06:47.140
It was me.

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:50.180
By Sig.

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:51.060
Ventriloquism?!

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:54.060
Don't do creepy voiceovers like that!

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:54.810
Hey!

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:57.730
I believe I said no shooting just because you feel like it.

00:06:57.730 --> 00:06:59.190
I'm sorry.

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:00.440
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:01.650
Let's get going.
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:02.730
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:05.450
Don't be late when we meet back up.
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:06.610
Gotcha!
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:28.930
It's pretty high up.

00:07:28.930 --> 00:07:30.680
Why does it say "House of Secrets"?

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:33.810
Secrets? It's gotta be pirates.

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:36.730
I bet there are tons of coins up there.

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:38.140
Pirates?

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:39.350
I doubt that.

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:41.360
Oh, it's here.

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:43.940
<i>Thank you for riding the gondola today...</i>

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:45.690
In this old kid's show I watched,
<i>Thank you for riding the gondola today...</i>

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.320
they had an action scene on top of a gondola.
<i>Thank you for riding the gondola today...</i>

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:47.860
they had an action scene on top of a gondola.

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:49.280
It was pretty amazing.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.370
They didn't have any safety lines either.

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:52.490
Really?

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.410
Lovers' Cape.

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:57.330
A frequent destination for honeymooners.

00:07:57.960 --> 00:07:58.960
What's this?!

00:07:58.960 --> 00:08:00.790
We're not allowed in!

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:02.290
It's 1,700 yen, too...

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:05.130
Which warlord built this castle?

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.010
Dunno.

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:09.680
They do know that it was destroyed by a monster once.

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:10.760
I see...

00:08:11.930 --> 00:08:14.260
Wow, how pretty.

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:15.930
Wow!

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:21.440
So,

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:22.940
how about we shoot something now?

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:25.860
Why?! We can't do that here!

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:28.950
Coming up here just to sightsee isn't really our style.

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:29.400
What?!

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:29.990
You've got a point.

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:30.990
No!

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:32.410
You guys!

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.530
It's about time to head back.

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:35.870
Okay!

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.210
What do you think?

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:43.750
Looks good, doesn't it?

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:45.590
This is a nice room.

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:47.130
How about we go to the hot springs?

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:48.970
Ignoring me, huh?

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:53.010
All right! I'm gonna make myself shine!

00:08:57.350 --> 00:08:58.890
You're on the phone with a guy?

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:00.690
What a surprise, Galil!

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:02.730
You're quite the go-getter, aren't you?

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:04.900
Well, I'll leave you to it. See you later.

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:06.520
It's great being young.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:09.860
It's almost like she's a normal middle school girl.

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:12.570
Oh, here it is.

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:13.530
Here we go!

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:15.780
I'm gonna be the first one in!

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.950
Sixteen-chan, you're being too loud.

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:19.660
It's fine.

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:23.170
It sounds like the practice that starts tomorrow is gonna be really tough.

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:24.630
Really?

00:09:24.920 --> 00:09:25.840
That sucks.

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:28.880
Let's take it easy tonight.

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:31.880
This hot spring is good for the skin, too.

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:35.510
We're all middle school girls, so why is she so much more...

00:09:37.060 --> 00:09:38.930
The water's so nice...

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:46.150
Elle.

00:09:47.110 --> 00:09:49.650
Since we're here, we've gotta wash each other, right?

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:51.610
It's fine.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:52.950
A heaven of nakedness!

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:56.910
How about here?

00:09:56.910 --> 00:09:57.490
We're not in elementary school anymore.
How about here?

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:59.370
Or here? Or here?!
We're not in elementary school anymore.

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:00.870
I think they need to learn more about proper bath etiquette.
Or here? Or here?!

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:02.460
You don't have to run!
I think they need to learn more about proper bath etiquette.

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:04.580
You don't have to run!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:06.250
Share some with me!

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:07.880
Sixteen-chan...
Share some with me!

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.840
Oh well.

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:10.960
We should join in, too.

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:11.800
Come on!

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:15.340
Don't do that, Sig!

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:17.430
You guys are way too loud!

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:19.350
Oh, it's Middle-3—

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:22.060
I told you that you'd regret it if you called me that—

00:10:22.060 --> 00:10:23.600
Mimi-chan, stop that!

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:24.560
You too?!

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:26.440
You are Mimi-chan, right?

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:28.940
Yeah, I suppose 33 could be read "Mimi"...

00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:40.910
I'm totally gonna rip you a new one at practice tomorrow, so prepare yourself!

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:43.660
You're pretty confident for such a minor gun.

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:44.790
Of course!

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:48.000
When it comes to reliability, you don't even compare to me!

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.000
What did you say?!

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.550
Calm down, you two...

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:53.760
We need to grab a few.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:54.880
Let's go.

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:56.300
Oh yeah, you're right.

00:10:57.180 --> 00:10:58.590
What are you talking about?

00:10:59.140 --> 00:11:00.350
Squid mugs.

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:02.640
Squid mugs?

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:08.060
Squid mugs are mugs made out of real squid.

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:11.150
Supposedly, they make beer and sake taste really good.

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:12.230
Really?

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:15.900
Though, we're still minors, so we can't drink yet.

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:20.580
And there's a legend that if we drink green tea from these mugs while we're on our school trip,

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:24.200
we'll get good grades at our practice.

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:25.660
What? Really?

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:42.720
I didn't know that!

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:45.810
Let's go buy some too, so we don't lose to them!

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:48.600
I won't lose, mug or no mug.

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:50.900
But I kinda want one anyway.

00:11:57.780 --> 00:11:58.780
Let's go.

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:01.620
Come on, you two. Get dressed.

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:02.120
That was fast.

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:05.080
Ready.

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:09.120
What <i>are</i> you doing?

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:10.170
Wait.

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:12.290
If we're not careful with this,

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:14.090
things are only going to get worse.

00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:18.420
There's a sergeant knot inside a figure-eight knot...

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:21.720
They're going to sell out of mugs!

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:23.100
I'm going on ahead.

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:31.270
<i>The target has left the building.</i>

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:35.270
The hawk has left the nest.

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:37.490
Oh, Fujiko-sensei.

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:39.280
No problems over there?

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:40.610
<i>They got me.</i>

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:41.740
<i>We've got three escapees.</i>

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.830
HK, Galil, and Eighteen.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:57.380
For god's sake... This is damn awful.

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:59.300
Mimi-chan, you should watch your language.

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:01.970
I told you to stop calling me that!

00:13:01.970 --> 00:13:03.390
Shush! You're too loud.

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:06.100
Come on. Let's hurry.

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:10.230
That was...

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:28.910
Man, are they at it again?

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:31.040
Galil-chan!

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:31.830
Mimi-chan!

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:45.470
AR18!

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:46.600
Galil AR!

00:13:58.610 --> 00:14:00.320
HK33E!

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:07.280
I'll take them.

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:08.240
Thank you.

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:10.870
Mire-sensei, be careful...

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:12.750
Don't worry.

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:15.460
Wounds like these aren't enough to kill these girls.

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:22.380
Japanese Teacher.

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:27.850
This has become troublesome.

00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:30.510
The bullets that hit them weren't ones used by any of our students.

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:33.810
The people who shot them are pretty good.

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:35.020
People?

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:36.350
There's no question about it.

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:38.980
If Eighteen had only been hit from a different angle,

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:41.940
that single bullet would've inflicted a fatal wound.

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:45.950
So what are they really trying to do, then?

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:50.910
Th-This is kind of rude, but who are you again?

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:52.750
Huh? Open your eyes already!

00:14:56.920 --> 00:14:57.960
Huh?!

00:14:57.960 --> 00:14:59.380
F-Fujiko-sensei?!

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:01.840
How could you not tell it's me?!

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:03.300
Well, you're really pretty right now...

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:04.220
What did you say?!

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:07.220
Did something happen?

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:11.640
AR18 was shot by someone near the shoreline road.

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:13.100
Eighteen-chan and the others?

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:14.520
So, what...

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:16.390
It wasn't that big a deal,

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:19.110
but we sent them all back home, just to be on the safe side.

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:22.530
So they need that much maintenance...

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:24.490
Who did this?!

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:25.700
We don't know,

00:15:25.700 --> 00:15:28.990
but whoever did it managed to hit all three girls' vital points.

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:30.490
This is unforgivable.

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:33.910
The shoreline road, you said?

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:35.870
H-Hey!

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:37.790
Wait, FNC!

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:39.250
I got it off!

00:15:42.340 --> 00:15:43.590
No...

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.920
Good work, Sig!

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:49.340
Our middle school doesn't allow us to have cell phones.

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:51.930
Who cares? We're on a seaside trip.

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:53.220
Oh, it's Eighteen.

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:55.850
Hello? What's wrong?

00:15:57.480 --> 00:16:00.230
Someone shot us.

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:01.650
<i>What did you say?!</i>

00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:03.980
Our group... All three of us...

00:16:04.530 --> 00:16:07.450
They hit each of our weak points...

00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:09.820
<i>Who would do something like that?!</i>

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:12.530
I don't know...

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:14.790
But there's one thing...

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:17.000
<i>I was only shot once.</i>

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:19.870
<i>The other two were shot three times.</i>

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:23.630
<i>I was shot two fewer times than the others.</i>

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:25.000
<i>Eighteen-san, are you okay?</i>

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:26.420
Eighteen!

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:27.760
Sixteen-san.

00:16:28.260 --> 00:16:30.010
You guys stay at the hotel.

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:33.430
We don't know what the shooters are after.

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:34.600
<i>Understood?</i>

00:16:37.270 --> 00:16:40.020
They're declaring war on me.

00:16:40.190 --> 00:16:41.480
Huh? How?

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:43.230
According to Eighteen,

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:46.230
the others were shot three times each,

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:48.570
but she was shot two fewer times.

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:50.990
In other words, minus two.

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:52.990
Eighteen minus two...

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:54.410
That's you, Sixteen!

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.450
I'm sure about this.

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:58.830
But why?

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:00.000
I don't know!

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.540
But if someone wants to play that game with me,

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:03.880
I'll just have to take them on.

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:05.040
Sixteen!

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:11.180
What are you trying to do, FNC?

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:13.470
My friends were shot!

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:16.260
Then let us take care of it.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:17.560
Go back to the hotel.

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:20.520
You need to go back or you'll be in danger.

00:17:20.770 --> 00:17:21.890
What?

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:25.400
You're human.

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:27.070
I'm a gun.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:36.950
Hide, Sensei!

00:17:48.090 --> 00:17:48.880
Sensei?

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.210
What was that?

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:51.300
I don't know,

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:53.180
but judging from the darkness

00:17:53.180 --> 00:17:55.680
and how loud the gunshots were,

00:17:55.680 --> 00:17:58.260
they're firing from pretty far away.

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:01.310
I think they're watching us right now.

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:04.270
So we're being fired at by an enemy we can't see...

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:06.230
Relax.

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:09.230
It's nighttime, so we might be able to see the muzzle flash.

00:18:11.490 --> 00:18:12.440
From the ocean?

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:13.240
In that case,

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:15.450
they should be unstable because of the boat rocking.

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:22.370
To shoot this well from the top of a boat, they must be pretty good.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:26.290
Don't push yourself too much.

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:29.340
You can just run from here and head back to the hotel.

00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:31.920
No. We have a chance to strike back.

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:33.010
FNC!

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:35.590
Practice was supposed to be tomorrow,

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.050
but I guess I'm getting started right now.

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:39.810
We don't know who we're up against.

00:18:39.810 --> 00:18:42.180
You're being much too laid back about all this.

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:46.520
Sensei, stay hidden.

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:48.020
FNC!

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:54.530
Too bad...

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:56.740
There's someone else here.

00:18:57.700 --> 00:18:58.490
Damn.

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:06.750
I won't forgive you for trying to hurt Funko-chan!

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:14.920
Fukko!

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:16.680
Are you okay?

00:19:16.680 --> 00:19:17.890
Guys...

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:18.890
Ow...

00:19:18.890 --> 00:19:19.800
Sensei?!

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:21.180
Have you been shot?

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:23.350
I'm fine. It's nothing.

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:25.230
I'm glad...

00:19:25.980 --> 00:19:27.560
What's this?

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:33.570
Fools. You are guns who have lost your true forms.

00:19:33.780 --> 00:19:36.610
You have no reason to exist.

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:37.660
What?!

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:39.820
On the stroke of 2400 hours,

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:42.950
we will commence our real attack.

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:47.460
You cannot run.

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:49.080
Either we win,

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:51.090
or you win.

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:54.590
We'll decide this here.

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:58.380
The guys from the East...

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:00.640
Bring it on.

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:03.430
But why us?

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:06.350
They think Sixteen is our leader.

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:08.100
Anyway, let's head back.

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:09.600
This isn't normal.

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:23.450
The hotel's in that direction.

00:20:37.050 --> 00:20:38.970
What's going on?

00:20:38.970 --> 00:20:41.050
What's happening?

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:43.100
Don't let them provoke you.

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:44.300
You guys are...

00:20:47.520 --> 00:20:50.310
They've done terrible things to Eighteen-chan and the others.

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:52.270
It's not something you have to get involved in.

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:55.820
But we're the ones they're after.

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:57.150
Yeah!

00:20:57.150 --> 00:20:59.700
Things'll only get worse if we don't go.

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:00.740
M16...

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:02.870
It's fine.

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:04.070
Just leave it to us.

00:21:05.080 --> 00:21:06.540
You guys!

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:09.910
So first of all, the shooters are still in the ocean.

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:12.370
There's only one place they can come ashore.

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:16.420
Make sure you don't kill them.

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:19.300
Unlike us, these Western folk

00:21:19.300 --> 00:21:21.880
try to save their wounded friends.

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:24.720
This is the perfect way to keep them busy.

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:27.510
What's going on?

00:21:28.270 --> 00:21:29.730
Why did this happen?

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:31.980
The East?

00:21:31.980 --> 00:21:32.690
A challenge?

00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:35.310
Why did this...

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:44.570
Hey, mister.

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:50.250
You'd better find some shelter.

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:56.460
This place is about to become a battlefield.

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:08.010
Let's tear another page off our calendar

00:22:09.060 --> 00:22:15.520
Together we braved

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:27.490
past ages and never-ending conflict

00:22:27.740 --> 00:22:35.120
Together we laughed and cried in those hectic times

00:22:35.960 --> 00:22:40.710
When I ran

00:22:43.630 --> 00:22:54.140
I put my footsteps into the ground

00:22:55.190 --> 00:23:01.860
Let's tear another page off our calendar

00:23:02.820 --> 00:23:09.030
Something is bound to change

00:23:10.450 --> 00:23:17.210
One by one the days I tore off pile up

00:23:17.710 --> 00:23:21.090
like a past I cannot erase

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:27.260
They will be my strength for days to come

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:33.850
This can't be happening!

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:35.310
I don't want everyone to shoot each other!

00:23:35.770 --> 00:23:37.640
Next time: And then, Upotte!!

00:23:37.940 --> 00:23:40.400
Can I tell you I love you?
